{"status":"success","record_count":11,"v_name":"FHL和合本","version":"unv","proc":0,"record":[{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":16,"sec":1,"bible_text":"（大衛的<WAH09001><WH01732>金詩<WH04387>。）　神<WH0410>啊，求你保佑我<WH08104>，因為<WAH03588>我投靠<WH02620><WTH8804>你<WAH09002>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":16,"sec":2,"bible_text":"我的心哪，你曾對耶和華<WAH09001><WH03068>說<WH0559><WTH8804>：你<WAH0859>是我的主<WH0136>；我的好處<WH02896>不<WAH01077>在你<WAH05921>以外。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":16,"sec":3,"bible_text":"論到<WAH0834>世上<WAH09002><WH0776>的聖民<WAH09001><WH06918>，他們<WH01992>又美又善<WH0117>，是我最<WAH03605>喜悅的<WH02656>{<WAH09002>}。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":16,"sec":4,"bible_text":"以別神代替耶和華的（或譯：送禮物<WH04116><WTH8804>給別<WH0312>神的），他們的愁苦<WH06094>必加增<WH07235><WTH8799>；他們所澆奠<WH05262>的血<WAH04480><WH01818>我不<WAH01077>獻上<WH05258><WTH8686>；我嘴唇<WAH05921><WH08193>也不<WH01077>提<WH05375><WTH8799>{<WAH0853>}別神的名號<WH08034>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":16,"sec":5,"bible_text":"耶和華<WH03068>是我的產業<WH02506>，是我杯<WH03563>中的分<WH04490>；我所得的<WH01486>，你<WAH0859>為我持守<WH08551><WTH8802>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":16,"sec":6,"bible_text":"用繩<WH02256>量<WH05307><WTH8804>給我<WAH09001>的地界，坐落在佳美<WAH09002><WH05273>之處；我的<WAH05921>產業<WH05159>實在<WAH0637>美好<WH08231><WTH8804>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":16,"sec":7,"bible_text":"我必稱頌<WH01288><WTH8762>{<WAH0853>}那<WAH0834>指教我的<WH03289><WTH8804>耶和華<WH03068>；我的心腸<WH03629>在夜間<WH03915>也<WAH0637>警戒我<WH03256><WTH8765>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":16,"sec":8,"bible_text":"我將耶和華<WH03068>常<WH08548>擺<WH07737><WTH8765>在我面前<WAH09001><WAH05048>，因<WAH03588>他在我右邊<WAH04480><WH03225>，我便不致<WAH01077>搖動<WH04131><WTH8735>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":16,"sec":9,"bible_text":"因此<WAH09001><WAH03651>，我的心<WH03820>歡喜<WH08055><WTH8804>，我的靈（原文是榮耀<WH03519>）快樂<WH01523><WTH8799>；我的肉身<WH01320>也要<WAH0637>安然<WAH09001><WH0983>居住<WH07931><WTH8799>。"},{"engs":"Ps","chineses":"詩","chap":16,"sec":10,"bible_text":"因為<WAH03588>你必不<WAH03808>將我的靈魂<WH05315>撇<WH05800><WTH8